OL,3,ABT agrees rescue deal to buy broadband
OL,4,Aoperator TalkTalk
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, Virgin Media called it a
OL,7,F"stitch-up" which allows BT to "tighten
OL,8,Fits grip" over the market. The
OL,9,Fgovernment has given itself the power
OL,10,Fto have the final say on the deal,
OL,11,Fciting its importance to vital public
OL,12,Fservices.
